{"id":2237,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为庆祝“三八”国际劳动妇女节，丰富女教职工的精神文化生活，营造欢乐祥和的节日氛围，我院工会于3月6日下午精心组织举办了“享益智游戏 三八乐开怀”女职工趣味活动，吸引了全院女教师积极参与。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMz9gZM8l8ol7DoLzL4UmGsUmAfUzQMRnNVRMRlsM4U4nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyYnkhVL1ysUlrRM8MVL4VfMRr7M7r2Ul-ZUmQVLRlsnNrFnmGinR-aLmTFLNUbLzGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D2DE27AEC7CE31A45D4EFAB8B6E057FE/F05D2029/2D910\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HL4UgPUmV2L4lioLR9iMzfRU4liLRGMiUmLZL4lYnlLaU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiLSyanSyDnm7Zn7LDnNLPnm9DnlCYoRUbMR7boz9aU4MFUz-sL4VRUzTFLz6kolCagtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyZozGsgtA8pUocc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动现场欢声笑语不断，气氛热烈。本次活动以“马年猜猜乐”系列益智游戏为主线，内容丰富多样，兼具知识性与趣味性。工会精心准备了涵盖多个领域的谜题，包括马年主题成语、新年祝福语、网络热梗、各地美食、地名以及大量成语猜谜等六大板块，共计数百道题目。女教师们或凝神思考，或相互探讨，在轻松愉快的氛围中开动脑筋，享受猜谜的乐趣，现场不时爆发出阵阵会心的笑声。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HM4rg2L7CiozLbML49bUz62LRnkUm-M4M4TkL8WkMzvaozU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4okhfn1y8oz7iMN-ZnRVkMz-8nz67M7LaLmMkM7-ZUzQFMNVfLln2L8rFLNlanN7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/038AF49156B8D1B524E7D4C023B4B8A6/6AA1DF3E/2E0FA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HLl-gsMzNDLRUZLLmlsLRNYUmvsMz9MbnzWknlQkMlMRnll0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyDLSy8nShfol-8M4UaMlnkLmUbLN74LRV7MzCPL8LZU46FM8UDnRfknmAFUmNZLmlJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.jpg\"></p><p>除了紧张有趣的益智游戏，活动还特别安排了健康知识学习环节。大家共同观看了“想要健康长寿这一天该怎么过”的科普视频，学习日常保健知识，提升了关注自身健康的意识。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HLmMg2nzLYoz-sLLlUbUlLPMzAVn7CMDMmLZUNLYM7r7L4l0gihFp2hmCIa0USyaLSybMSybnNLDLmlDnll8MRlsMmNioRQkUNn2Lmr2LNnFnR-PoR7DL4VFL4GsU8UJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A01959FC6256EE445769586BBDF25F2D/D2181631/307CD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HUz7gsUmLsMzvDLLzAknzWknz7YUmLMPMzN8L7CbUmVVnRG0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZLkyaLSy8M7C4L4laUzVfnzn2nzLsUmGPnz6kMlW7nzTFnmrkMzNYLNrFoRLDoR-Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMzGgPLmA7LNQ2LL46RLNVRLmnknm7MYnzT7nRNiUzv4L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyaMky8U1hkL8CanzCDnNUbn7VRozUZoz9iLz7bUz9bMz6FnzU4M8CYo7WFMm7bozGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D044BB3F0E66FD9DAC948985119A8957/E437F28B/61990\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMzGgPLmA7LNQ2LL46RLNVRLmnknm7MYnzT7nRNiUzv4L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyaMky8U1hkL8CanzCDnNUbn7VRozUZoz9iLz7bUz9bMz6FnzU4M8CYo7WFMm7bozGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次趣味活动不仅让女教职工们在繁忙的工作之余放松了身心，感受到了节日的喜悦和集体的温暖，也为大家提供了一个交流互动、增进情谊的平台。活动结束后，大家纷纷表示，此次活动形式新颖、内容有趣，既愉悦了心情，又增长了知识，未来将以更加积极乐观的心态和饱满的热情投入到工作和生活中，做到调节心理、放松身心、快乐工作。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMz9gZM8l8ol7DoLzL4UmGsUmAfUzQMRnNVRMRlsM4U4nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyYnkhVL1ysUlrRM8MVL4VfMRr7M7r2Ul-ZUmQVLRlsnNrFnmGinR-aLmTFLNUbLzGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg49bLRvJqdonx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=8907&e=.jpg"}